    Slide {
      chapter: "Premise"
      label: "Data-oriented Debugging with autopsy"
      notes: "Hello! I'm Jeff, a PhD student at Penn, and today I'm excited to tell you about Data-Oriented Debugging Across Place and Time, which is an analytical lens for thinking about the fundamentals of debugging and debugging tools"
